</li>
</ul><hr/></article><article class="rule-card" id="card-chapter-12"><h3 class="chapter-heading" id="chapter-12">0DTE 盘中动态演变与时效特征</h3><h4 class="rule-heading">1. 早盘阶段 (06:30 - 08:30 西雅图时间)</h4><ul>
